Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 13:57:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/49] R3: parallel scrypt validates its parameters exactly as
 x/crypto's scrypt.Key

The hand-written lanes did no validation. A key file with N=6, p=2 indexed
past the stride table and crashed the process in a worker goroutine; N=12 or
N=20 derived a key where stock stops with "scrypt: N must be > 1 and a power
of 2". checkScryptParams repeats the three checks of scrypt.Key (same
conditions, order and texts) and runs before anything else in
parallelScryptKey.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
